  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SPTO Digital Transformation (Tourism)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Originally a four-year&#xa0;Activity (2021 - 2024) extended through a no cost extension to September 2026, support is provided to the Pacific Tourism Organisation (SPTO) for Organisational&#xa0;capacity-building, digital services delivery and COVID-19 recovery by the Pacific tourism sector.
This supports the SPTO to deliver its Strategic Plans 2021-2024 and 2025-2030, with a focus on.&lt;ul&gt;  &lt;li&gt;sustainable planning and development&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;destination marketing and tourism data&lt;/li&gt;  &lt;li&gt;statistical information&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
